Package: com.albrhi.spotify
Name: Albrhi for Spotify
Version: 0.2.5
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: No ads in Spotify — audio, display and upsell popups. WITHOUT PREMIUM: this tweak does not unlock a paid subscription, does not touch your account, and does not remove the skip limit. It blocks advertising, which it does on a free account exactly as it does on a paid one.
Section: Tweaks
Depends: ${ORION}, mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 15.0)
Author: Ibrahim Ismail AL-Rahn <ibrahimalrahan01@gmail.com>
Maintainer: Ibrahim Ismail AL-Rahn <ibrahimalrahan01@gmail.com>
Conflicts: com.albrhi.spotify.roothide, com.eevee.spotify
Replaces: com.albrhi.spotify.roothide
Tag: role::hacker
